fire-cleansed space, invoking purification, karmic release, and divine activation. This is where the intention is sealed. The Fire element ensures the energy is not only embedded but anchored in your auric field.<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_Yjpjy4","text_Vh8L49"]}},"block_order":["title_mLUpJe","group_hUmbKw"]}},"name":"t:names.editorial","settings":{"media_position":"right","media_width":"medium","media_height":"60svh","section_width":"page-width","extend_media":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"media_with_content_ric3tH":{"type":"media-with-content","blocks":{"media":{"type":"_media-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"media_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/1_74144464-4080-4bd5-aa93-41dd32dba257.jpg","link":"","video_loop":true,"video_autoplay":false,"image_position":"contain","video_position":"cover"},"blocks":{}},"content":{"type":"_content-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"space-between","gap":0},"blocks":{"title_Hq3kxN":{"type":"title","settings":{"heading_size":"h3","title":"<p><strong>11 Part Healing<\/strong><\/p>","font":"--font-family-second","color":"#8b631a","font_size":30,"line_height":40,"letter_spacing":0,"font_weight":"500","font_style":"normal","align":"center","padding":"","margin":"0 0 20px","color_mobi":"#8b631a","font_size_mobi":25,"line_height_mobi":30,"letter_spacing_mobi":0,"align_mobi":"left"},"blocks":{}},"group_wFteRU":{"type":"group","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_6rLAaV":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>For daily wearers, emotional shifts, intention setting, and karmic balancing<\/strong><\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"paragraph","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_AgqJqD":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>This ritual follows the sacred trinity of <strong>Light · Sound · Fire<\/strong>, and includes:<\/p><p><strong>1. Sound Alignment - Frequency Tuning -<\/strong> A chosen Solfeggio frequency is played over the crystal using tuning forks, bowls, and chants, activating its healing purpose through sound.<\/p><p><strong>2. Karmic Integration<\/strong> - Each piece is matched to your <strong>numerology number <\/strong>or <strong>soul code<\/strong>, or <strong>karmic healing need <\/strong>ensuring it resonates with the lessons your soul is here to complete.<\/p><p><strong>3. Moon\/ Sun Cleansing<\/strong> - According to the crystal’s dominant energy, it is cleansed under the lunar or solar light.<\/p><p><strong>4. Elemental Cleansing<\/strong> - Each piece is first passed through <strong>earth (soil\/ salt), air (incense\/ sacred smoke) <\/strong>and <strong>water (Gangajal \/Rosewater\/ Charged rainwater) <\/strong>to cleanse residue and prepare it for coding.<\/p><p><strong>5. Smudging with Sacred Herbs<\/strong> - Cleared with sage, palo santo, or camphor smoke for etheric purification.<\/p><p><strong>6. Light Coding<\/strong> - Imbued with channeled light codes through crystal grids, symbols, and hand-transmissions.<\/p><p><strong>7. Mantra Seeding<\/strong> - Blessed with Bija mantras recitation in a 108-bead cycle inviting divine grace and gentle holding from the universe.<\/p><p><strong>8. Fire Sealing<\/strong> - Passed through flame (not burning) to seal the intention with transformation and power.<\/p><p><strong>9. Aura Holding<\/strong> - Held within the energy field of Lightworker- Master Aakriti, ensuring energetic imprinting.<\/p><p><strong>10. Breath of life Transfer<\/strong> - The final activation. The breath of stillness and life force is gently passed to complete the encoding.<\/p><p><strong>11. Wrapped with Sankalp (Intention)<\/strong> - The crystal is tied or packed with a sile<\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_6rLAaV","text_AgqJqD"]}},"block_order":["title_Hq3kxN","group_wFteRU"]}},"name":"t:names.editorial","settings":{"media_position":"left","media_width":"medium","media_height":"60svh","section_width":"page-width","extend_media":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"media_with_content_7AERFH":{"type":"media-with-content","blocks":{"media":{"type":"_media-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"media_type":"image","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Healings_copy_e7ebd698-70ad-4322-a63c-40cd31972b17.jpg","link":"","video_loop":true,"video_autoplay":false,"image_position":"contain","video_position":"cover"},"blocks":{}},"content":{"type":"_content-without-appearance","static":true,"settings":{"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"space-between","gap":0},"blocks":{"title_f7RGkd":{"type":"title","settings":{"heading_size":"h3","title":"<p><strong>21 Part Healing<\/strong><\/p>","font":"--font-family-second","color":"#8b631a","font_size":30,"line_height":40,"letter_spacing":0,"font_weight":"500","font_style":"normal","align":"center","padding":"","margin":"0 0 20px","color_mobi":"#8b631a","font_size_mobi":25,"line_height_mobi":30,"letter_spacing_mobi":0,"align_mobi":"left"},"blocks":{}},"group_cHVFj4":{"type":"group","settings":{"content_direction":"column","vertical_on_mobile":true,"horizontal_alignment":"flex-start","vertical_alignment":"center","align_baseline":false,"horizontal_alignment_flex_direction_column":"flex-start","vertical_alignment_flex_direction_column":"center","gap":12,"width":"fill","custom_width":100,"width_mobile":"fill","custom_width_mobile":100,"height":"fit","custom_height":100,"inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","background_media":"none","video_position":"cover","background_image_position":"cover","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"toggle_overlay":false,"overlay_color":"#00000026","overlay_style":"solid","gradient_direction":"to top","link":"","open_in_new_tab":false,"placeholder":"","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"text_ikmeAw":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Reserved for limited editions, advanced souls, and major<\/strong><\/p><p><strong>karmic initiations<\/strong><\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"paragraph","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground-heading)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"text_TcfzYi":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>This is the <strong>Tat Sat Signature Energy Ceremony<\/strong>, done when required by deep spiritual journeys or advanced guidance. It includes all of the 11 above, and adds:<\/p><p><strong>12. Ancestral Flame Invocation<\/strong> - We call upon lineage guides and ancient lightworkers to witness and bless the activation.<\/p><p><strong>13. Sacred Geometry Placement<\/strong> - The crystal is placed in a specific grid aligned with its planetary and elemental archetype.<\/p><p><strong>14. Blessing with Sacred Flowers <\/strong>- Each crystal is anointed with fresh flowers, sacred ash, and sandalwood<\/p><p><strong>15. Mudra Charging<\/strong> - It is held in mudras (hand gestures) to lock in frequency using subtle body alignment.<\/p><p><strong>16. Mirror Blessing<\/strong> - A sacred mirror is used to reflect divine light back into the Crystal, amplifying manifestation power.<\/p><p><strong>17. Flame Circle Sealing<\/strong> - The crystal is gently circled around a sacred flame in three rotations, symbolizing purification, transformation, and divine embodiment.<\/p><p><strong>18. Light Code Enhancement<\/strong> - Higher-level light codes are added based on karmic pattern decoding and soul mission.<\/p><p><strong>19. Chakra Resonance Tuning<\/strong> - Tuned to key chakras through sound and silence, depending on the bracelet’s purpose.<\/p><p><strong>20. Silence Holding<\/strong> - The crystal rests in stillness and darkness for 21 minutes to integrate the light.<\/p><p><strong>21. Energy Field Charging - Grid of Light <\/strong>- The crystal is placed in a crystal grid of light, encircled by activated wands and sacred symbols. Under the glow of <strong>Tat Sat’s collective frequency<\/strong>, it becomes <strong>lit from within.<\/strong><\/p>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_ikmeAw","text_TcfzYi"]}},"block_order":["title_f7RGkd","group_cHVFj4"]}},"name":"t:names.editorial","settings":{"media_position":"right","media_width":"medium","media_height":"60svh","section_width":"full-width","extend_media":true,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0}},"product_recommendations_Wapw3m":{"type":"product-recommendations","blocks":{"text_H8HB9b":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.header","settings":{"text":"<p>FEATURED COLLECTION<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"center","type_preset":"h4","font":"var(--font-primary--family)","font_size":"","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"static-product-card":{"type":"_product-card","name":"t:names.product_card